000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. LINREOPN.
000300*LINAGE-COUNTER is 1 when the file is opened, IV-15 -- every time
000400*it is opened. It once carried on from where the last CLOSE left
000500*it, so a report closed and reopened broke its pages at the wrong
000600*lines (#38).
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000900 FILE-CONTROL.
